IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Row il-51. NOUNS of a cross-reference and of a per-person rate. No rule is written here; the facts below are what a reader of the texts could state.
-- TARGET COMPILER: main. No REFUSE, no section GIVEN, no TYPICALLY, no YMD, no sets: a case the sources do not answer is NOTHING from a MAYBE.
--
-- This row is NOT an encoding of the Privacy Protection Law, 5741-1981. It records citations: for each, what the citing words say they point at, what the target is,
-- and where each of the two readings comes from. A citation whose two descriptions differ is a defect, and is kept in an expected-red file.
--
-- THE KINDS BELOW ARE MINE, not the Law's: each is a short plain description I wrote from reading the citing words and the target, so that two descriptions of the same
-- thing are the same kind. The words of the texts are quoted beside each value in the references module. An `ext:[law]`, `ext:[eea]`, `ext:[pb]`, `ext:[inspect]`,
-- `ext:[abroad]`, `ext:[fine]` or `ext:[interp]` line is copied by tools/extquote.py from a deposited consolidation (the first three are deposited as excerpts, and the tag
-- cites the line number of the whole page). An `ext:[SH 3287 ...]`, `ext:[KT ...]` or `ext:[YP ...]` line is typed from a page image of the official instrument.
-- "Amendment 13" is the Privacy Protection Law (Amendment 13) of 5784-2024, Sefer HaChukim 3287.

§ `Nouns of a cross-reference`

DECLARE `What a provision is about` IS ONE OF
    `section 7 of the Law as the citing words take it: a section in force`
    `section 7 of the Law as it reads now: repealed, so that the section prints no text`
    `section 7 of the Law as the citing words take it: the section that defines terms such as רשם and מאגר מידע`
    `section 7 of the Law as the citing words take it: the section that makes information sensitive, מידע רגיש`
    `section 12 of the Law as the citing words take it: the book called פנקס of databases`
    `section 12 of the Law as it reads now: the register called מרשם of databases, kept by ראש הרשות`
    `the office called הרשם in the Law as the citing words take it`
    `the office called ראש הרשות, defined in section 3 of the Law as it reads now, which section 1(2) of Amendment 13 puts in the place of הרשם`
    `the person called בעל מאגר in the Law as the citing words take it`
    `the person called בעל שליטה, defined in section 3 of the Law as it reads now, which section 1 of Amendment 13 puts in the place of בעל מאגר`
    `section 31א(א) of the Law as the schedule takes it: a section in force, with paragraphs (1) to (7)`
    `section 31א of the Law as it reads now: repealed, so that the section prints no text`
    `section 17א of the Law as the schedule takes it: a section in force, with subsections (א) and (ב)`
    `section 17א of the Law as it reads now: repealed, so that the section prints no text`
    `section 17ד of the Law as it reads now: a section headed דיוור ישיר that prints text`
    `the definition of ראש הרשות in section 3 of the Law`
    `subsections (א) and (ב) of section 12 of the Law`
    `the definition of מידע בעל רגישות מיוחדת in section 3 of the Law, whose paragraph (12) the Second Schedule sets out, and which names regulation 7 of the 2023 regulations`
    `section 23ג of the Law, headed סייג לאיסור`
    `regulation 5 of the 1981 inspection regulations, headed הודעה על סירוב`
    `regulation 2 of the 2023 regulations, headed תחולה`
    `regulation 1 of the 2001 regulations on transfer abroad, headed הגבלת העברה של מידע לחו״ל`

-- Three kinds of reading, from the strongest to the weakest.
-- The second kind is the honest name for most limbs here: the official page was read, but that no LATER instrument touched the words rests on the consolidation's list of amending instruments.
DECLARE `Where a reading comes from` IS ONE OF
    `the official instrument, read from its page image`
    `the official instruments read from their page images; that no later instrument touched the words is CONSOLIDATION-ONLY`
    `the consolidation only`

DECLARE `A cross-reference` HAS
    `the citing words are in` IS A STRING
    `the citing words say it points at` IS A `What a provision is about`
    `the target is` IS A `What a provision is about`
    `the text the citing words name stopped being the text in force on` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `read through the Interpretation Law section 25 the citing words reach` IS A MAYBE `What a provision is about`
    `limb (a) was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`
    `limb (b) was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`

§ `Nouns of a per-person rate`

-- Amounts are whole agorot (a hundredth of a shekel), so that no figure is a fraction: 51.18 shekels is 5118.
DECLARE `A per-person rate` HAS
    `what the rate is for` IS A STRING
    `the Law prints, in agorot` IS A NUMBER
    `the notice of 7 October 2026 prints, in agorot` IS A NUMBER
    `the Law's figure was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`
    `the notice's figure was read from` IS A `Where a reading comes from`
